      "content": "That's a strong start for the curriculum. To make it even more impactful for the students, can you expand on the specific reasons why administrators believed these populations weren't capable of governing themselves? For example, could you go into more detail about the perceived differences in temperament, intelligence, or social organization that made British oversight seem like a necessity at the time?",
